{"steam_appid":2891020,"steam_name":"Undusted: Letters from the Past","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2891020/2069944374/606c3ff4756cd3968ed57cd3774140931217fd11/1758769187/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758773444","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205884/6639a0e12d17eab24e964a9b9998aed0562ebea7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758773444","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/4b05ff0ab39c26461786588df6944073d0f0d27c/ss_4b05ff0ab39c26461786588df6944073d0f0d27c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761872202","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/5519c22190916e1e6f275f8efa11612f26b84b92/ss_5519c22190916e1e6f275f8efa11612f26b84b92.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761872202","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/3283684aa5904fd56a0ebe5e970d18c9da96f695/ss_3283684aa5904fd56a0ebe5e970d18c9da96f695.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761872202","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/ea8d47cb3cc205971ae8f4eb6468c10f893a3d7d/ss_ea8d47cb3cc205971ae8f4eb6468c10f893a3d7d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761872202","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/d18b9de3c65a620db3d5e1864e9267f7c4ad9556/ss_d18b9de3c65a620db3d5e1864e9267f7c4ad9556.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761872202"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IIn Undusted: Letters from the Past, you are tasked with cleaning items that have fallen into disrepair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dust, scrub, and polish your way through the chapters to learn the personal backstory behind each item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/7ff224faa6d3815ed48e38b24d56f20d.avif?t=1761872202\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adora returns home after her mother's passing.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She starts to clean long-neglected items inside her family home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As those items are restored to their original conditions, they start whispering memories of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As Adora cleans, she discovers a myriad of forgotten stories, some hidden away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What kind of stories will she experience? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Virtual ASMR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience carefully crafted sound effects that capture the essence of each tool you use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each chapter's ambient audio will wholly immerse you in the game! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Touching Story<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Recall the memories associated with each item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When did Adora and her mother's relationship start to fall apart? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will she be able to finally understand her mother after her passing? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Charming Art Style<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Appreciate a captivating art style that is uniquely expressed through pixelated textures.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a heartfelt and emotional story about family. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget about time limits and failure—just relax and enjoy! The items won't break like they would in real life! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Admire beautiful artwork that charmingly portrays Adora's story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to original background music that complements the relaxing gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the oddly satisfying feeling from ASMR and restoration videos, but in a game!  </p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 Ghz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A DirectX11-compatible GPU (Shader Model 5.0)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 Ghz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A DirectX11-compatible GPU (Shader Model 5.0)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["5minlab Corp."],"publishers":["Toge Productions"],"release_date":"13 Oct, 2025"}